<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>{{credentialTitle}} Expiry Warning - {{clubName}}</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      background-color: #f4f4f4;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 20px auto;
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #F59E0B 0%, #D97706 100%);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 35px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .header h1 {
      margin: 0 0 8px 0;
      font-size: 26px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .header p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 15px;
      opacity: 0.95;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 30px 20px;
    }
    .urgency-banner {
      background: #FFFBEB;
      border: 2px solid #FCD34D;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 25px 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .urgency-banner h2 {
      margin: 0 0 8px 0;
      font-size: 20px;
      color: #B45309;
    }
    .urgency-banner p {
      margin: 0;
      color: #92400E;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .credential-details {
      background: #F8FAFC;
      border-left: 4px solid #F59E0B;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 25px 0;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .credential-details h3 {
      margin: 0 0 15px 0;
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #1E293B;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .detail-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 10px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    }
    .detail-row:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }
    .detail-label {
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #64748B;
    }
    .detail-value {
      color: #1E293B;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .expiry-date {
      font-size: 18px;
      color: #B45309;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .action-required {
      background: #FEF3C7;
      border-left: 4px solid #F59E0B;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 25px 0;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .action-required h3 {
      margin: 0 0 12px 0;
      font-size: 18px;
      color: #D97706;
    }
    .action-required ol {
      margin: 10px 0;
      padding-left: 20px;
      color: #78350F;
    }
    .action-required li {
      margin: 8px 0;
    }
    .consequences {
      background: #FEF2F2;
      padding: 16px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      border-radius: 4px;
      border: 1px solid #FECACA;
    }
    .consequences p {
      margin: 0;
      color: #7F1D1D;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .consequences strong {
      color: #991B1B;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #F59E0B;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 14px 32px;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin: 20px 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .button-container {
      text-align: center;
      margin: 30px 0;
    }
    .footer {
      background: #F8FAFC;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      color: #64748B;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .footer p {
      margin: 5px 0;
    }
    .footer a {
      color: #B45309;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>{{credentialType}} expiring soon</h1>
      <p>Please renew before it lapses</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <p>Dear {{firstName}} {{lastName}},</p>

      <p>Your {{credentialTitle}} recorded with {{clubName}} is coming up for renewal.</p>

      <div class="urgency-banner">
        <h2>Expires in {{daysUntilExpiry}} days</h2>
        <p>Renew now so your record stays up to date</p>
      </div>

      <div class="credential-details">
        <h3>Credential details</h3>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Credential:</span>
          <span class="detail-value">{{credentialTitle}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Type:</span>
          <span class="detail-value">{{credentialType}}</span>
        </div>
        {{#if issuingBody}}
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Issued by:</span>
          <span class="detail-value">{{issuingBody}}</span>
        </div>
        {{/if}}
        {{#if referenceNumber}}
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Reference number:</span>
          <span class="detail-value">{{referenceNumber}}</span>
        </div>
        {{/if}}
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Issue date:</span>
          <span class="detail-value">{{issueDate}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Expiry date:</span>
          <span class="detail-value expiry-date">{{expiryDate}}</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="action-required">
        <h3>What to do next</h3>
        <ol>
          <li><strong>Book your renewal</strong> with the awarding body or through {{clubName}}</li>
          <li><strong>Send the new certificate</strong> to the club as soon as it is issued</li>
          <li><strong>Keep the current certificate</strong> to hand until the replacement arrives</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="consequences">
        <p><strong>Important:</strong> if this credential lapses, the club may not be able to roster you for sessions that require it until a current record is in place.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="button-container">
        <a href="{{credentialsUrl}}" class="button">View credential records</a>
      </div>

      <p style="margin-top: 30px;"><strong>Need help?</strong></p>
      <p>If you have questions about the renewal, please contact the club:</p>
      <ul style="margin-top: 10px;">
        {{#if contactNumber}}
        <li>Phone: {{contactNumber}}</li>
        {{/if}}
        <li>Reply to this email and it will reach the club office</li>
      </ul>

      <p style="margin-top: 25px;">Thank you for keeping your records current.</p>

      <p style="margin-top: 20px;">
        Best regards,<br>
        <strong>{{clubName}}</strong>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>&copy; {{year}} {{clubName}}. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p>Sent by {{brandName}}. <a href="{{supportUrl}}">Contact support</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
